> No.  See <http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Allmain.c#line186>
>
>                 } else if (Regeneration ||
>                      (u.ulevel <= 9 &&
>                       !(moves % ((MAXULEV+12) / (u.ulevel+2) + 1)))) {
>                     flags.botl = 1;
>                     u.uhp++;
>                 }
>
> The use of the macro "Regeneration" means that you get one extra HP
> every turn if you have any form of regeneration.  It does not check if
> you have more than one.
